codex
The real translated constructor is mechanically identical to the `solutionProgram` macro, and a body mutation (`words[3]` → `words[0]`) makes the theorem fail with the expected residual. So the proof is body-sensitive and result-constraining. The material defect lies elsewhere: the universal claim runs the body on an invented `VFruits(A,O)` value whose `split` rule directly fabricates the two numbers, while actual strings are only covered by four ground claims.
exec
/bin/bash -lc 'bash /audit-output/evidence/06_nonvacuity.sh 2>&1 | tee /audit-output/evidence/06_nonvacuity.log
status=${PIPESTATUS[0]}; echo "SCRIPT_EXIT_STATUS=$status" | tee -a /audit-output/evidence/06_nonvacuity.log; exit "$status"' in /audit-output
